OL,3,AUS removes Syria from list of state
OL,4,Asponsors of terrorism
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has removed Syria from its list
OL,7,Fof state sponsors of terrorism after 47
OL,8,Fyears, lifting what it said was the
OL,9,F"final major barriers" for private
OL,10,Fsector investment in the country and
OL,11,Fits reintegration into the global
OL,12,Feconomy.
OL,14,FUS Secretary Of State Marco Rubio said
OL,15,Fthe move was in recognition of the
OL,16,FSyrian government's positive actions to
OL,17,Ffully distance itself from acts of
OL,18,Finternational terrorism.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
